    "description": "PHYSIO backend API — ADMIN routes. Traceability: Backend Execution Ready STCs. Use PHYSIO-Backend-Execution environment. Folder **Prerequisite** runs kine login first so kineId/cabinetId/profileId are set for /api/admin/v1/kines/{kineId}/… paths.",
